WEBVTT

00:17:28.402 --> 00:17:31.650
the given was that accident;

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:35.338
I had no option but to make up

00:17:35.338 --> 00:17:38.394
this new life without walking.

00:17:38.394 --> 00:17:42.202
Intent -- a life with intent --

00:17:42.202 --> 00:17:44.026
lived by design,

00:17:44.026 --> 00:17:45.642
covering the original

00:17:45.642 --> 00:17:47.202
with something better.

00:17:47.202 --> 00:17:52.282
It's something for all of us to do or find a way to do in these times.

00:17:52.282 --> 00:17:55.624
To get back to this,

00:17:55.624 --> 00:17:57.760
to get back to design,

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:01.161
and as my daddy suggested a long time ago,